        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">The <a href="mx">MX Linux</a> project has published a new update to the 25.x series. Along with importing new security fixes and firmware from its Debian parent, the MX Linux project includes a number of new changes: "<span class="Quote">On the MX side, we have pushed most of our updates as we’ve gone along, but there are some specific updates of note this time around. MX-Welcome, MX-Tools and custom-toolbox (used by Fluxbox) received user interface facelifts. Verify-iso-sig, a new tool for verifying digital signatures for not only MX ISOs, but also isos from many popular distribution families. MX-Theme-Colors, a fun tool for creating custom-highlight themes from existing MX themes (GTK). Introduction of siduction 7.X kernels in mx-packageinstaller-&gt;popular apps-&gt;kernels Many updates to the third-party vpn installers in mx-packageinstaller-&gt;popular apps mx/gazelle-installer will set up lazytime in fstab by default (new installations). Updated manual and FAQ entries
Translation updates for most mx-tools. All bugfix, maintenance, and feature releases since our last official release. Existing users do not need to reinstall.  All updates come through the regular update channel.</span>" The <a href="https://mxlinux.org/blog/mx-25-3-infinity-isos-now-available/">release announcement</a> offers further details. <a href="https://mxlinux.org/blog/mx-25-3-infinity-isos-now-available/">Download</a> (<a href="table.php?distribution=mx&pkglist=true&version=25.3#pkglist">pkglist</a>): <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_x64.iso">MX-25.3_Xfce_x64.iso</a> (2,792MB, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_x64.iso.sha256">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_x64.iso.sig">signature</a>, <a href="https://l2.mxrepo.com/torrents/MX-25.3_Xfce_x64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>), <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_ahs_x64.iso">MX-25.3_Xfce_ahs_x64.iso</a> (3,041MB, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_ahs_x64.iso.sha256">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_Xfce_ahs_x64.iso.sig">signature</a>, <a href="https://l2.mxrepo.com/torrents/MX-25.3_Xfce_ahs_x64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>), <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_KDE_x64.iso">MX-25.3_KDE_x64.iso</a> (3,478MB, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_KDE_x64.iso.sha256">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/mx-linux/MX-25.3_KDE_x64.iso.sig">signature</a>, <a href="https://l2.mxrepo.com/torrents/MX-25.3_KDE_x64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>).</td>
